      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abarume abarula khuYohana Omubatisii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa Yesu yali namalile okhulachilisia abeechibe abo ekhumi nababili, yarulaho natsia okhwechesia niyeelwatsa mumataala kabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho olwa Yohana yahulia nali mumbohe akebikhole biaKristo oyol yaruma abeechibe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhumureeba, mbu Iwe niwe omwenoyo owitsa, nohomba khulindiilile oundi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nakalusia nababoolela mbu Mulatsia mumuboolele Yohan amakhuwa aka muhulilanga nende aka mulolanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu ababofu banyalilungwa okhulola, abetsindieku bachendanga, abobuchele basiiyungwa, abeekala amarwi bahulilanga, abafu balamusibungwa, abamanani nabo beelwatsilungwa Amakhuwa Amalayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne noweikhabi omundu yesi oureesichirasibwa khwisie ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeenabo olwa bali nibatsiitsanga, Yesu yachaaka okhusunjila abemikanda khukaYohana, ari Nishiina eshia mwarula nimutsia mushitsiimi okhulola? Mbu olusi olureesibwa nomuyeka noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nishiina eshia mwarula nomutsia okhulola? Mbu omundu owifwalile tsingubo tsinndorotoro? Mbula, abeefwala tsindorotoro bali mutsinzu tsiabaruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nishiina eshiachila nimurula nimutsia? Okhulola omunabii noho? Ee, khandi emuboolela mbu noushila omunabii muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uno nomwenoyo owa kahandiichilwakhwo, mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhurula mundaalo tsiaYohana Omubatisii okhuula bulaano, obwami obwomwikulu bwinjilungwa namahababa, abandu bamahababa nibabwitsumbanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila abanabii bosi nende amalako bali nibalakulanga okhuula khuYohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nimuba nimwenya okhukafuchiilila, uno niye Eliya owali nali okhwitsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouli; namarwi akokhuhulila, ahulile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenjelasie abolwibulo luno nende shiina? Bafwana shinga abaana abeekhaale haluyia, abalanjilisia abashiabwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibasunga bari Khumuupiile lilele, nimurashina ta; khwikhuulile, nimurakhupa tsimbungu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila Yohana yeetsa naraliitsanga kata okhunywa ta, nibaboola bari Ali nende lidimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana wOmundu naye yeetsa naliitsanga nende okhunywa, nibaboola bari Lole, nomulangu, khandi omumeesii, omwitsa wabasololi bobushuru nende aboonooni! Ne obuchesi bumanyikhanga shinga olwa buli habwene khulwa emilimo chiabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Woowe khumatookho akareekalukhasia ta!",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nachaaka okhuhalabila amatookho ako aka yayinya okhukholelangamwo emilimochie chiamakana, shichila shikali nikeekalukhasiye ta; ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wowe khwiwe, Korazini! Wowe khwiwe, Betsesaida! Shichila emilimo chiamakana echiakholelwa mwinywe chilaba nichiakholelwa muTiro nende Sidoni, khane bakheekalukhasiye khale nibeefwalile amakunia nibeepuuka likoshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa emuboolela mbu kalibakhwo amaangu khulwa Tiro nende Sidoni khunduukho yeshiina okhushila shinga olwa kalimubeela inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe, Kaperinaumu, witsa okhuchinguulwa mwikulu? Mbula, witsa okhwishila okhuula eMakombe; shichila emilimo chiamakana echiakholelwa mwiwe chilaba nichiakholelwa muSodomu, khane liakhabeeleho okhuula olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa emuboolela mbu kalibakhwo amaangu khulwa eshialo shiaSodomu khunduukho yeshiina okhushila shinga olwa kalikhubeela iwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwitse khwisie, muhuluushe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwenaho Yesu yakalusia naboola mbu E Papa, Omwami welikulu nende eshibala, ekhuupila orio, shinga olwa wabisa abachesi nabarechelefu smakhuwa kano, nokabisulila abaana abahele; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orio, Papa, okhuba nolwa kakaasa imbeliwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papa yambeelesia ebindu biosi; ne abulaho oumanyile Omwana, habula Samwana; khandi abulaho oumanyile Papa, habula Omwana, nende omundu yesi owa Omwana achama okhumubisulila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:27"
          },
